
---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Submissions Closed | Pazhassi Short Film Festival Season 03">
  <div
    class="relative min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden border-b-2 border-black bg-[#B31D12] px-4 py-12 text-[#FDFCF7] selection:bg-[#FDB813] selection:text-[#B31D12] sm:px-12 sm:py-20"
  >
    <!-- Decorative background -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden opacity-15">
      <div
        class="absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 h-4 border-b border-[#FDB813]/40"
        style="background-image: radial-gradient(#FDB813 35%, transparent 35%); background-size: 16px 16px;"
      ></div>
      <div
        class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-4 border-t border-[#FDB813]/40"
        style="background-image: radial-gradient(#FDB813 35%, transparent 35%); background-size: 16px 16px;"
      ></div>
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10"
        style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #FDB813 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, #FDB813 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"
      ></div>
    </div>

    <main class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-8">
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="space-y-5 border-b border-[#FDB813]/30 pb-8">
        <nav
          class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200"
          aria-label="Breadcrumb"
        >
          <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#FDB813]">
            &larr; Home
          </a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span>Submissions</span>
        </nav>

        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#FDB813] sm:text-sm">
          3rd Pazhassi Short Film Festival · Season 03
        </p>

        <h1
          class="max-w-4xl font-mono text-4xl font-black uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
        >
          Submissions<br />
          <span class="text-[#FDB813]">Closed.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-100 sm:text-lg">
          Thank you to every filmmaker who submitted a film to PSFF Season 03.
          The submission period has officially ended, and the selection
          process is now underway.
        </p>

        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#FDB813]/60 bg-black/15 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FDB813]"
        >
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FDB813]"></span>
          Entries Under Evaluation
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Main announcement -->
      <section
        class="space-y-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-black bg-[#FDFCF7] p-6 text-[#18181B] shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#000000] sm:p-10"
      >
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#B31D12]">
          The Selection Process
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-mono text-2xl font-black uppercase leading-tight sm:text-3xl">
          The next chapter begins.
        </h2>

        <p class="leading-relaxed text-zinc-700">
          All submitted entries are currently being evaluated by the
          <strong>PSFF Screening Panel</strong>. Following this evaluation,
          the Top 10 films will be selected for screening at the festival venue
          on <strong>28 November 2026</strong>.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://psff.in/jury/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-black bg-[#FDB813] px-5 py-3 font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#18181B] transition-all hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-none"
        >
          Meet the Jury
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Timeline -->
      <section class="space-y-5">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#FDB813]">
            What Happens Next?
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-mono text-2xl font-black uppercase sm:text-3xl">
            From evaluation to awards.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
          <!-- Stage 01 -->
          <article
            class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border-2 border-black bg-[#FDFCF7] p-6 text-[#18181B] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_0px_#000000]"
          >
            <span class="font-mono text-sm font-black text-[#B31D12]">
              STEP 01
            </span>

            <h3 class="mt-4 font-mono text-lg font-black uppercase">
              Screening Panel Evaluation
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-700">
              The Screening Panel is reviewing the submitted films to determine
              the final selection.
            </p>

            <span
              class="mt-5 inline-flex w-fit rounded-full border border-[#B31D12]/30 bg-[#B31D12]/5 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#B31D12]"
            >
              In Progress
            </span>
          </article>

          <!-- Stage 02 -->
          <article
            class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border-2 border-black bg-[#FDFCF7] p-6 text-[#18181B] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_0px_#000000]"
          >
            <span class="font-mono text-sm font-black text-[#B31D12]">
              STEP 02
            </span>

            <h3 class="mt-4 font-mono text-lg font-black uppercase">
              Top 10 Films
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-700">
              The selected filmmakers will be notified through the official
              website and email. The Top 10 films will be screened at the
              festival venue.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-5 border-t border-black/10 pt-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase text-[#B31D12]">
                28 November 2026
              </span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Stage 03 -->
          <article
            class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border-2 border-black bg-[#FDFCF7] p-6 text-[#18181B] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_0px_#000000]"
          >
            <span class="font-mono text-sm font-black text-[#B31D12]">
              STEP 03
            </span>

            <h3 class="mt-4 font-mono text-lg font-black uppercase">
              Awards & Winners
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-700">
              The Main Jury Panel will select the award winners from the Top
              10 films. The winners will be announced on the day of the
              festival.
            </p>

            <span
              class="mt-5 inline-flex w-fit rounded-full border border-black/15 bg-black/5 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-600"
            >
              Festival Day
            </span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Participant notification -->
      <section
        class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#FDB813]/50 bg-black/10 p-6 sm:p-8"
      >
        <h2 class="font-mono text-lg font-black uppercase sm:text-xl">
          To all participating filmmakers
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-100 sm:text-base">
          Thank you for sharing your creativity and stories with Pazhassi
          Short Film Festival. If your film is selected among the Top 10,
          you will be informed through the official website and email.
          Please keep an eye on your inbox and stay tuned for festival updates.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer
        class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 border-t border-[#FDB813]/30 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-sm font-black uppercase">
            Pazhassi Short Film Festival
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-300">
            Season 03 · 2026
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FDB813] transition-colors hover:text-white"
        >
          &larr; Back to Home
        </a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
